      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POWER VALLEY (4) has been a in top form recording back to back wins and both in best of the card, going 20.08 two back before 19.95 last time. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Well placed and will be tough to beat. BARLEY CHARLIE (2) flew the lids with a fast early split and led until late but gathered in when a 0.8 lengths second at this track over 350m in 20.10. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Will give a great sight again. WHAT'S THE PRICE (1) had won two in a row before finishing sixth (20.32) last time at this track. Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. NUGGET ROBERTS (7) was well fancied last time on the strength of the win two back but could only manage second (20.20) at this track.",
